# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rebana License sandbox credential.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored and MUST stay
# that way — the sandbox rules assume a leaked credential is a matter of time,
# so do not paste these into a coding AI, a ticket, or a chat.
#
# The four values come from the license app's admin, from
# Tetapan > Sandbox Pembangun > Provision. The secret and password are shown
# ONCE at provision time and are not retrievable afterwards; if they are lost
# the only recovery is rotating, which kills any integration already running on
# the old pair.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL of the license app. No trailing slash.
SANDBOX_BASE_URL=https://rebana.canang.com.my/rebana-license

# OAuth client — the id pattern is derived by the fleet, not configurable.
SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID=rebana-license-sandbox-client
SANDBOX_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Sandbox user — username pattern is likewise derived.
SANDBOX_USERNAME=license-sandbox
SANDBOX_PASSWORD=

# App origin: set to the exact public HTTPS origin behind a reverse proxy.
# APP_ORIGIN=https://rentara.example

# Use a persistent disk in production. Default: ./data/rentara.db
# RENTARA_DB_PATH=/persistent-volume/rentara.db
